  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Buried under a pile of rocks after a zombie dragon tail strike, he shouts the name from under the stones. The sky bursts open and a small hill is aimed at the zombie dragon. Hei Lou Lan’s eyelids twitch at how fast it activates. Stronger immortal killer moves normally need more time, but this one is both strong and very quick. The zombie dragon does not dodge. It raises its head and rams the hill. The move has no effect.",
