        "char_hei_lou_lan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the rolling rock battlefield breaks, he flips his palm and names the move again while Seven Star Child immortal zombie uses One Star Finger. Both attacks are short to activate and high in offensive power. A huge mountain rock presses down on the immortal zombie, sends it crashing to the ground, and buries it under a small hill. The rock then breaks apart as a huge starlight hand smashes it to shards.",
